 * JSFX Name: ALiXiA_Reference Track Band Isolator 
 * About: Allows Isolation / Soloing of Sub, Mids, Tops 
 * Author: ALiXiA and REA
 * Author URI: https://a4pz.com
 * Donation: https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=GXEUXZN7GD7W4
